@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
allowmixing
title HISTORICAL broader-product proposal — Proposed — Integration types and evidence boundaries
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

component "Applications" as A
component "Presentation" as P
component "Files" as F
component "Communication / Calendar" as C
cloud "Provider" as M
actor "User / actual external portal action" as U
A --> P : in-process exact permitted revision projection
A --> F : opaque artifact reference + reservation/finalization protocol
A --> C : permitted correspondence/activity reference
C --> M : actual supported provider transport; separate intent
U --> A : explicitly record real event and provenance
note bottom of A
 No messaging broker, event bus or direct raw file-transfer protocol selected.
 SQL commit is not atomic with bytes or provider effects.
end note

@enduml
